Notebook[{Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["banddata", "ObjectName"], Cell[TextData[{Cell["   ", "ModInfo"], Cell[BoxData["banddata[path,npoint,H,rules,file]"], "InlineFormula"], " \:2028", "\:628a H \:6cbf path \:7684\:6570\:503c\:80fd\:91cf\:5199\:5165\:6570\:636e\:6587\:4ef6\:3002"}], "Usage"], Cell["\:4ee3\:5165 rules \:540e\:ff0c\:51fd\:6570\:6309 bandplot \:76f8\:540c\:7684\:5012\:7a7a\:95f4\:5206\:6570\:5750\:6807\:8def\:5f84\:53d6\:6837\:3002\:6587\:4ef6\:4e2d\:6bcf\:4e2a\:91c7\:6837\:52a8\:91cf\:5360\:4e00\:884c\:ff0c\:6bcf\:6761\:80fd\:5e26\:5360\:4e00\:5217\:3002", "Notes"], Cell["\:9700\:8981\:5171\:4eab notebook \:65f6\:ff0c\:8bf7\:7528 FileNameJoin \:6784\:9020\:8def\:5f84\:ff0c\:4e0d\:8981\:5199\:6b7b\:67d0\:53f0\:673a\:5668\:4e0a\:7684\:7edd\:5bf9\:8def\:5f84\:3002", "Notes"]}, Open]], Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["\:8303\:4f8b\:521d\:59cb\:5316", "ExamplesInitializationSection"], Cell[BoxData["Needs[\"MagneticTB`\"]"], "ExampleInitialization"]}, Open]], Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["\:57fa\:672c\:8303\:4f8b", "PrimaryExamplesSection"], Cell["\:521d\:59cb\:5316\:77f3\:58a8\:70ef\:ff0c\:6784\:9020 Hamiltonian \:548c\:5012\:7a7a\:95f4\:8def\:5f84\:ff0c\:5e76\:9009\:62e9\:4e00\:4e2a\:53ef\:79fb\:690d\:7684\:4e34\:65f6 CSV \:6587\:4ef6\:ff1a", "ExampleText"], Cell[BoxData["Needs[\"MagneticTB`\"];\ngrapheneOperations = msgop[gray[191]];\ninit[\n  lattice -> {\n    {a, 0, 0},\n    {-a/2, Sqrt[3] a/2, 0},\n    {0, 0, c}\n  },\n  lattpar -> {a -> 1, c -> 3},\n  wyckoffposition -> {\n    {{1/3, 2/3, 0}, {0, 0, 0}}\n  },\n  symminformation -> grapheneOperations,\n  basisFunctions -> {{\"pz\"}}\n];\ngrapheneHamiltonian = Sum[symham[i], {i, 3}];\ngraphenePath = {\n  {{{0, 0, 0}, {0, 1/2, 0}}, {\"G\", \"M\"}},\n  {{{0, 1/2, 0}, {1/3, 1/3, 0}}, {\"M\", \"K\"}},\n  {{{1/3, 1/3, 0}, {0, 0, 0}}, {\"K\", \"G\"}}\n};\ngrapheneBandFile = FileNameJoin[{$TemporaryDirectory, \"graphene-band.csv\"}];"], "Input"], Cell["\:5bfc\:51fa\:53d6\:6837\:5f97\:5230\:7684\:80fd\:5e26\:80fd\:91cf\:300